      "q": "How much does Peraton make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Peraton obligated $1.8B from federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Peraton received 278 awards for the period, with an average award size of $6.4M and obligations down 15.5% year over year."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Peraton?",
      "a": "Peraton's top buyers in FY2026 to date are the General Services Administration at $644M, the Department of Defense at $370M, and the Department of Transportation at $213M. Other notable buyers include the National Aeronautics and Space Administration at $186M and the Department of Health and Human Services at $115M."
    },
